[38.933747, "o", "package main\r\n\r\n// Starting scaffold for the `mlreport` CLI.\r\n//\r\n// Implement the evaluation report engine described in docs/spec_v1.md:\r\n//   - `evaluate`: compute metrics from raw predictions and generate\r\n//     Markdown + JSON reports for binary / multiclass / regression tasks.\r\n//   - `compare`: compare two evaluations and detect regressions.\r\n//\r\n// Later rounds extend this per docs/spec_v2.md … spec_v7.md.\r\nfunc main() {}\r\n"]
