[47.481975, "o", "   241\t**JSON report** (`report.json`):\r\n   242\t\r\n   243\t```json\r\n   244\t{\r\n   245\t  \"model\": {\r\n   246\t    \"name\": \"<string>\",\r\n   247\t    \"version\": \"<string>\",\r\n   248\t    \"task_type\": \"<string>\"\r\n"]
[47.482118, "o", "   249\t  },\r\n   250\t  \"splits\": {\r\n   251\t    \"<split_name>\": {\r\n   252\t      \"dataset\": \"<string>\",\r\n   253\t      \"metrics\": {\r\n   254\t        \"<metric_name>\": <float>\r\n   255\t      },\r\n   256\t      \"confusion_matrix\": {\r\n   257\t        \"classes\": [\"<class_1>\", \"<class_2>\", ...],\r\n   258\t        \"matrix\": [[<int>, ...], ...]\r\n   259\t      },\r\n   260\t      \"per_class_metrics\": {\r\n   261\t        \"<class>\": {\r\n   262\t          \"precision\": <float>,\r\n   263\t          \"recall\": <float>,\r\n   264\t          \"f1\": <float>,\r\n   265\t          \"support\": <int>\r\n   266\t        }\r\n   267\t      }\r\n"]
[47.482243, "o", "   268\t    }\r\n   269\t  }\r\n   270\t}\r\n   271\t```\r\n   272\t\r\n   273\tFields that don't apply to the task type (e.g., `confusion_matrix` for regression, `per_class_metrics` for binary) are omitted from the JSON output entirely (not set to null or empty).\r\n   274\t\r\n   275\t### 4.2 Compare Command Output\r\n   276\t\r\n   277\t**Markdown report** (`comparison.md`):\r\n   278\t\r\n   279\t```\r\n   280\t# Model Comparison Report\r\n   281\t\r\n   282\tBaseline: <name> v<version>\r\n   283\tCandidate: <name> v<version>\r\n   284\tTask type: <task_type>\r\n   285\t\r\n   286\t## Performance Delta\r\n   287\t\r\n   288\t| Metric | Split | Baseline | Candidate | Delta | Relative Delta |\r\n   289\t|--------|-------|----------|-----------|-------|----------------|\r\n   290\t| <metric> | <split> | <value> | <value> | <delta> | <rel_delta>% |\r\n"]
[47.482313, "o", "   291\t\r\n   292\t(One row per (metric, split) pair. Metrics in standard order, then splits in manifest order. Relative delta = (candidate - baseline) / |baseline| * 100, show \"N/A\" if baseline is near zero.)\r\n   293\t\r\n   294\t## Regression Analysis\r\n   295\t\r\n   296\t| Metric | Severity | Regressed Splits | Verdict |\r\n   297\t|--------|----------|-----------------|---------|\r\n   298\t| <metric> | <severity> | <split_1>, <split_2>, ... | PASS / REGRESSED |\r\n   299\t\r\n   300\t(Only metrics defined in the regression config. If a metric did not regress on any split, verdict is PASS.)\r\n   301\t\r\n"]
[47.482471, "o", "   302\t## Overall Verdict\r\n   303\t\r\n   304\tResult: PASS / FAIL\r\n   305\tCritical regressions: <count> / <max_allowed>\r\n   306\tWarning regressions: <count> / <max_allowed>\r\n   307\t```\r\n   308\t\r\n   309\t**JSON report** (`comparison.json`):\r\n   310\t\r\n   311\t```json\r\n   312\t{\r\n   313\t  \"baseline\": { \"name\": \"<string>\", \"version\": \"<string>\" },\r\n   314\t  \"candidate\": { \"name\": \"<string>\", \"version\": \"<string>\" },\r\n   315\t  \"task_type\": \"<string>\",\r\n   316\t  \"deltas\": {\r\n   317\t    \"<split>\": {\r\n   318\t      \"<metric>\": {\r\n   319\t        \"baseline\": <float>,\r\n   320\t        \"candidate\": <float>,\r\n   321\t        \"absolute_delta\": <float>,\r\n   322\t        \"relative_delta\": <float_or_null>\r\n   323\t      }\r\n"]
[47.482576, "o", "   324\t    }\r\n   325\t  },\r\n   326\t  \"regression_analysis\": {\r\n   327\t    \"<metric>\": {\r\n   328\t      \"severity\": \"<string>\",\r\n   329\t      \"regressed_splits\": [\"<split>\", ...],\r\n   330\t      \"verdict\": \"PASS\" | \"REGRESSED\"\r\n   331\t    }\r\n   332\t  },\r\n   333\t  \"overall\": {\r\n   334\t    \"verdict\": \"PASS\" | \"FAIL\",\r\n   335\t    \"critical_regressions\": <int>,\r\n   336\t    \"max_critical_regressions\": <int>,\r\n   337\t    \"warning_regressions\": <int>,\r\n   338\t    \"max_warning_regressions\": <int>\r\n   339\t  }\r\n"]
[47.482682, "o", "   340\t}\r\n   341\t```\r\n   342\t\r\n   343\t---\r\n   344\t\r\n   345\t## 5. CLI Interface\r\n   346\t\r\n   347\t### 5.1 Evaluate Command\r\n   348\t\r\n   349\t```\r\n   350\tmlreport evaluate --manifest <path> --output-dir <path> [--format md|json|both]\r\n   351\t```\r\n   352\t\r\n   353\t- `--manifest` (required): Path to evaluation manifest JSON file.\r\n   354\t- `--output-dir` (required): Directory for output files. Created if it does not exist.\r\n   355\t- `--format` (optional, default `both`): Output format. `md` for Markdown only, `json` for JSON only, `both` for both.\r\n   356\t\r\n   357\t**Output files:**\r\n"]
[47.482799, "o", "   358\t- `<output-dir>/report.md` (when format is `md` or `both`)\r\n   359\t- `<output-dir>/report.json` (when format is `json` or `both`)\r\n   360\t\r\n"]
