[4750.609071, "o", "    60\t\tPredictedNum     float64\r\n    61\t\tProbabilities    map[string]float64\r\n    62\t\tHasProbabilities bool\r\n    63\t}\r\n    64\t\r\n    65"]
[4750.609171, "o", "\ttype RegressionConfig struct {\r\n    66\t\tThresholds map[string]Threshold `json:\"thresholds\"`\r\n    67\t\tRules      Rules                `json:\"rules\"`\r\n    68\t}\r\n    69\t"]
[4750.60927, "o", "\r\n    70\ttype Threshold struct {\r\n    71\t\tMaxDelta         *float64 `json:\"max_delta,omitempty\"`\r\n    72\t\tMaxRelativeDelta *float64 `json:\"max_relative_delta,omitempty\"`\r\n    73\t\tMinAbsoluteDelta float64  `json:\"min_absolute_delta\"`\r\n    74\t\tMinRelativeDelta float64  `json:\"min_relative_delta\"`\r\n    75\t\tSeverity         string   `json:\"severity\"`\r\n    76\t}\r\n    77\t\r\n    78\ttype Rules struct {\r\n    79\t\tMaxCriticalRegressions int `json:\"max_critical_regressions\"`\r\n    80\t\tMaxWarningRegressions  int `json:\"max_warning_regressions\"`\r\n    81\t}\r\n    82\t\r\n    83\ttype ConfusionMatrixReport struct {\r\n    84\t\tClasses []string `json:\"classes\"`\r\n    85\t\tMatrix  [][]int  `json:\"matrix\"`\r\n    86\t}\r\n    87\t\r\n    88\ttype PerClassMetric struct {\r\n    89\t\tPrecision float64 `json:\"precision\"`\r\n    90\t\tRecall    float64 `json:\"recall\"`\r\n    91\t\tF1        float64 `json:\"f1\"`\r\n    92\t"]
[4750.60937, "o", "\tSupport   int     `json:\"support\"`\r\n    93\t}\r\n    94\t\r\n    95\ttype CI struct {\r\n    96\t\tLower float64 `json:\"lower\"`\r\n    97\t\tUpper float64 `json:\"upper\"`\r\n    98\t}\r\n    99\t\r\n   100\ttype SplitReportJSON struct {\r\n   101\t\tDataset             string                    `json:\"dataset\"`\r\n   102\t\tMetrics             map[string]float64        `json:\"metrics\"`\r\n   103\t\tConfusionMatrix     *ConfusionMatrixReport    `json:\"confusion_matrix,omitempty\"`\r\n   104\t\tPerClassMetrics     map[string]PerClassMetric `json:\"per_class_metrics,omitempty\"`\r\n"]
[4750.60944, "o", "   105\t\tConfidenceIntervals map[string]CI             `json:\"confidence_intervals,omitempty\"`\r\n   106\t}\r\n   107\t\r\n   108\ttype ReportJSON struct {\r\n   109\t\tModel  Model                      `json:\"model\"`\r\n   110\t\tSplits map[string]SplitReportJSON `json:\"splits\"`\r\n   111\t}\r\n   112\t\r\n   113\ttype EvalResult struct {\r\n   114\t\tMetrics         map[string]float64\r\n"]
[4750.609507, "o", "   115\t\tMetricOrder     []string\r\n   116\t\tConfusionMatrix *ConfusionMatrixReport\r\n   117\t\tPerClassMetrics map[string]PerClassMetric\r\n   118\t}\r\n   119\t\r\n"]
[4750.609566, "o", "   120\ttype ModelRef struct {\r\n   121\t\tName    string `json:\"name\"`\r\n   122\t\tVersion string `json:\"version\"`\r\n   123\t}\r\n   124\t\r\n   125\ttype DeltaEntry struct {\r\n   126\t\tBaseline      float64  `json:\"baseline\"`\r\n   127\t\tCandidate     float64  `json:\"candidate\"`\r\n   128\t\tAbsoluteDelta float64  `json:\"absolute_delta\"`\r\n   129\t\tRelativeDelta *float64 `json:\"relative_delta\"`\r\n   130\t}\r\n   131\t\r\n   132\ttype RegressionAnalysisEntry struct {\r\n   133\t\tSeverity        string   `json:\"severity\"`\r\n"]
[4750.609642, "o", "   134\t\tDirection       string   `json:\"direction\"`\r\n   135\t\tRegressedSplits []string `json:\"regressed_splits\"`\r\n   136\t\tVerdict         string   `json:\"verdict\"`\r\n   137\t}\r\n   138\t\r\n   139\ttype Overall struct {\r\n   140\t\tVerdict                string `json:\"verdict\"`\r\n   141\t\tCriticalRegressions    int    `json:\"critical_regressions\"`\r\n   142\t\tMaxCriticalRegressions int    `json:\"max_critical_regressions\"`\r\n   143\t\tWarningRegressions     int    `json:\"warning_regressions\"`\r\n   144\t\tMaxWarningRegressions  int    `json:\"max_warning_regressions\"`\r\n   145\t}\r\n   146\t\r\n   147\ttype ComparisonData struct {\r\n"]
[4750.609727, "o", "   148\t\tBaseline           ModelRef                           `json:\"baseline\"`\r\n   149\t\tCandidate          ModelRef                           `json:\"candidate\"`\r\n   150\t\tTaskType           string                             `json:\"task_type\"`\r\n   151\t\tSplitOrder         []string                           `json:\"-\"`\r\n   152\t\tMetricOrder        []string                           `json:\"-\"`\r\n   153\t\tDeltas             map[string]map[string]DeltaEntry   `json:\"deltas\"`\r\n   154\t\tRegressionMetrics  []string                           `json:\"-\"`\r\n   155\t\tRegressionAnalysis map[string]RegressionAnalysisEntry `json:\"regression_analysis\"`\r\n   156\t\tOverall            Overall                            `json:\"overall\"`\r\n   157\t}\r\n   158\t\r\n   159\tfunc round6(x float64) float64 {\r\n   160\t\tif math.IsNaN(x) || math.IsInf(x, 0) {"]
[4750.609797, "o", "\r\n"]
