[4754.971745, "o", "Thresholds map[string]Threshold `json:\"thresholds\"`\r\n    67\t\tRules      Rules                `json:\"rules\"`\r\n    68\t}\r\n    69\t\r\n    70\ttype Threshold struct {\r\n    71\t\tMaxDelta         *float64 `json:\"max_delta,omitempty\"`\r\n    72\t\tMaxRelativeDelta *float64 `json:\"max_relative_delta,omitempty\"`\r\n    73\t\tMinAbsoluteDelta float64  `json:\"min_absolute_delta\"`\r\n    74\t\tMinRelativeDelta float64  `json:\"min_relative_delta\"`\r\n    75\t\tSeverity         string   `json:\"severity\"`\r\n    76\t}\r\n    77\t\r\n    78\ttype Rules struct {\r\n    79\t\tMaxCriticalRegressions int `json:\"max_critical_regressions\"`\r\n    80\t\tMaxWarningRegressions  int `json:\"max_warning_regressions\"`\r\n    81\t}\r\n"]
[4754.971795, "o", "    82\t\r\n    83\ttype ConfusionMatrixReport struct {\r\n    84\t\tClasses []string `json:\"classes\"`\r\n    85\t\tMatrix  [][]int  `json:\"matrix\"`\r\n    86\t}\r\n    87\t\r\n    88\ttype PerClassMetric struct {\r\n    89\t\tPrecision float64 `json:\"precision\"`\r\n    90\t"]
[4754.971995, "o", "\tRecall    float64 `json:\"recall\"`\r\n    91\t\tF1        float64 `json:\"f1\"`\r\n    92\t\tSupport   int     `json:\"support\"`\r\n    93\t}\r\n    94\t\r\n    95\ttype CI struct {\r\n    96\t\tLower float64 `json:\"lower\"`\r\n    97\t\tUpper float64 `json:\"upper\"`\r\n    98\t}\r\n    99\t\r\n   100\ttype SplitReportJSON struct {\r\n   101\t\tDataset             string                    `json:\"dataset\"`\r\n   102\t\tMetrics             map[string]float64        `json:\"metrics\"`\r\n   103\t\tConfusionMatrix     *ConfusionMatrixReport    `json:\"confusion_matrix,omitempty\"`\r\n   104\t\tPerClassMetrics     map[string]PerClassMetric `json:\"per_class_metrics,omitempty\"`\r\n   105\t\tConfidenceIntervals map[string]CI             `json:\"confidence_intervals,omitempty\"`\r\n   106\t}\r\n   107\t\r\n"]
[4754.972143, "o", "   108\ttype ReportJSON struct {\r\n   109\t\tModel  Model                      `json:\"model\"`\r\n   110\t\tSplits map[string]SplitReportJSON `json:\"splits\"`\r\n   111\t}\r\n   112\t\r\n   113\ttype EvalResult struct {\r\n   114\t\tMetrics         map[string]float64\r\n   115\t\tMetricOrder     []string\r\n   116\t\tConfusionMatrix *ConfusionMatrixReport\r\n   117\t\tPerClassMetrics map[string]PerClassMetric\r\n   118\t}\r\n   119\t\r\n   120\ttype ModelRef struct {\r\n"]
